add('Policy assertions cover lead protection, urgency, three-point decisions, regulation/OT boundaries and foul guards. Historical tests check legal winners, nonnegative counts, scoring identities, minutes and chronological events. Existing completed game results are not recalculated. The baseline hash manifest verifies that production files other than the two intended modules, including city photographs, remain unchanged.')
